  },
  "expected_benefit": "Fewer nominal failures (reduced occurrences of nominal_performance = 0), larger positive safety margins on average, and modestly increased exploration of safe regions that could raise robust_performance_mc. Maintains robust_performance_mc as the dominant objective.",
  "validation_plan": "Validator should observe (within the next accepted state) a reduction in fraction of candidates with cliff_margin ≤ 0 and/or an increase in the weighted objective score driven by safer candidates. Also expect no drop in the robust_performance_mc best/mean due to the small, targeted nature of the change.",
  "confidence": 0.7
