  "validation_plan": "Validator will compare the optimizer's next accepted-state objective mixture performance (the fixed validation used by the system). Success hypothesis: the new objective weighting yields an accepted-state improvement or at least prevents a regression in safety-related metrics (observable via the system's normal validation metric).",
